Ran into the issue. Thanks Eric for posting the solution.

I've created a PR (https://bitbucket.org/sequenzatools/sequenza/pull-requests/3) that includes the solution in hopes that it will help others avoid this in the futur.

On Tuesday, December 12, 2023 at 1:57:50 PM UTC-8 Francesco Favero wrote:
