> > I believe that the problem arises because the argument names of function itools::chunk.apply have changed since version 0.3-3 <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/iotools/NEWS>. I believe that, in function sequenza::gc.sample.stats, the argument parallel of the call to chunk.apply should be renamed CH.PARALLEL.
